      "message": "\u003e We were using hyp_page_ref_dec/inc apis which were actually private apis for pkvm buddy allocator\n\nAre they? IIUC there are hyp_page structures in pKVM\u0027s vmemmap for all pages of the available RAM. The buddy allocator is just one of the users of it. (And it\u0027s the same in pKVM-ARM, which also uses hyp_page_ref_dec/inc for the same purpose as this reverted CL.)\n\nMaybe we rather have some bug in our vmemmap implementation, or something?",
